{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果全新摺機Apple iPhone Duo明晚（16日）8時起接受預訂，本港售價介乎17,499元（256GB）至最貴27,999元（2TB）。</p><p>貴為史上最貴的iPhone，加上其「矜貴」的摺疊內螢幕，其維修費用可說是「天價」。</p><p>蘋果香港公布iPhone Duo的「估計維修服務費用」，若Apple提供的保養期已過，內顯示器損壞的維修費為8,749元，等同半部新機的售價，亦比一部全新、售7,799元起</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T03:00:10.807560+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":0,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"rss-empty","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T02:55:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T03:37:39.424927+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T02:57:40.779331+00:00","content_hash":"50282f4889c80d7abd0999dc6c20c01c65e37d96ba13b22cb8d61d3737fc3d95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}